{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"clojure","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"Clojure","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Clojure (.clj .cljs .cljc .edn).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"clojure","name":"Clojure","extensions":[".clj",".cljs",".cljc",".edn"],"grammar":"grammars/clojure.json","lineComment":";"}],"snippets":[{"language":"Clojure","path":"snippets/clojure.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/clojure.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"match\": \";.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \":[A-Za-z0-9_\\\\-.*+!?/]+\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"#?\\\\{|\\\\}|\\\\[|\\\\]\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:defprotocol|defmethod|defrecord|defmacro|defmulti|when-let|when-not|deftype|defonce|finally|require|dotimes|if-let|if-not|import|defn-|letfn|recur|catch|throw|quote|condp|doseq|while|defn|loop|when|cond|case|def|let|try|var|use|for|and|not|do|fn|if|ns|or)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:false|true|nil)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:println|partial|filter|reduce|dissoc|update|print|first|assoc|count|range|apply|rest|cons|conj|comp|str|map|get|inc|dec)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/clojure.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Function\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"defn\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"(defn ${1:name}\",\n      \"  [${2:args}]\",\n      \"  $0)\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A function\"\n  },\n  \"Namespace\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ns\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"(ns ${1:name}\",\n      \"  (:require [${2:lib} :as ${3:l}]))\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A namespace\"\n  },\n  \"Let\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"let\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"(let [${1:x} ${2:1}]\",\n      \"  $0)\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"let bindings\"\n  },\n  \"Cond\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"cond\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"(cond\",\n      \"  ${1:test} ${2:result}\",\n      \"  :else $0)\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"cond\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Clojure\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Clojure.\n\n## Files\n\n`.clj`, `.cljs`, `.cljc`, `.edn`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `;`.\n- 4 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `defn` | A function |\n| `ns` | A namespace |\n| `let` | let bindings |\n| `cond` | cond |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}